---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { imageUrl } from '../lib/image-assets';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Roots & Relics Greenhouse | Come Wander"
  description="Roots & Relics Greenhouse — storied antiques, seasonal gatherings, and an unforgettable day in Southern Oregon."
  currentPath="/"
>
<main id="main">
      <section class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src={imageUrl('homephoto.png')} alt="" data-parallax />
        </div>
        <div class="hero-shade"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="kicker reveal">Antiques · gatherings · greenhouse days</p>
          <h1 class="reveal">Come for the <em>find.</em><br />Stay for the feeling.</h1>
          <div class="hero-bottom reveal">
            <a class="hero-main-cta" href="/our-story/">Explore the greenhouse <span>→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stamp reveal" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>ROOTS &amp; RELICS</span>
          <b>R&amp;R</b>
          <span>SOUTHERN OREGON</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="ticker-track">
          <span>Primitive furniture</span><i>✦</i><span>European antiques</span><i>✦</i><span>Ironstone</span><i>✦</i><span>Textiles</span><i>✦</i><span>Architectural salvage</span><i>✦</i><span>Seasonal botanicals</span><i>✦</i>
          <span>Primitive furniture</span><i>✦</i><span>European antiques</span><i>✦</i><span>Ironstone</span><i>✦</i><span>Textiles</span><i>✦</i><span>Architectural salvage</span><i>✦</i><span>Seasonal botanicals</span><i>✦</i>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="manifesto section" id="story">
        <div class="manifesto-mark reveal">R&amp;R</div>
        <div class="manifesto-copy">
          <h2 class="reveal">New houses deserve<br />old <em>souls.</em></h2>
          <div class="manifesto-text reveal">
            <p>We gather the worn, the storied, and the beautifully useful—pieces that bring warmth, character, and a sense of belonging to the places you call home.</p>
            <a class="action-link" href="/our-story/">Meet Roots &amp; Relics <span>↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portrait-window reveal">
          <img src={imageUrl('77-painted-cupboard-scale.jpg')} alt="A painted antique cupboard arranged with a scale, basket, and gathered pieces" loading="lazy" />
          <span>There is always<br />something new to notice.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="manifesto-aside reveal">
          <p>A little out of the way.<br />Easy to settle into.<br />Hard to forget.</p>
          <span>SOUTHERN OREGON · APPROX. 10 MINUTES FROM KLAMATH FALLS</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="experience section" id="gatherings">
        <div class="experience-heading">
          <h2 class="reveal">Not a shop.<br /><em>A whole Saturday.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="collage" aria-label="Scenes from a day at Roots and Relics">
          <figure class="collage-main reveal">
            <img src={imageUrl('112-gathering-guests.jpg')} alt="Friends enjoying a greenhouse gathering" loading="lazy" />
          </figure>
          <figure class="collage-float collage-float-one reveal">
            <img src={imageUrl('88-vignette-pitcher-flowers.jpg')} alt="Dried flowers gathered in a vintage metal pitcher" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption>Fresh blooms, naturally.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="collage-float collage-float-two reveal">
            <img src={imageUrl('104-refreshments-table.jpg')} alt="Refreshments arranged for greenhouse guests" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption>Something good is always on the table.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="hand-note reveal">Bring the girls.<br />We’ll make a day of it. <span>♡</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-copy reveal">
          <p>Wander through the collection, take the long way around the farm, gather over something delicious, and leave with a story tucked into the back of the car.</p>
          <a class="pill-link" href="/greenhouse-gatherings/">See upcoming weekends <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="collection section" id="collection">
        <div class="collection-intro reveal">
          <h2>The pieces you remember<br /><em>long after you leave.</em></h2>
          <p>Good bones, honest wear, and the occasional surprise. The mix changes constantly, so every visit begins somewhere new.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="collection-grid">
          <a class="collection-card collection-wide reveal" href="/the-collection/">
            <img src={imageUrl('100-cat-architectural-salvage.jpg')} alt="Architectural salvage and collected objects" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>Architectural salvage</b></span>
          </a>
          <a class="collection-card collection-tall reveal" href="/the-collection/">
            <img src={imageUrl('101-cat-primitive-furniture.jpg')} alt="Primitive antique furniture" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>Primitive furniture</b></span>
          </a>
          <a class="collection-card collection-square reveal" href="/the-collection/">
            <img src={imageUrl('102-cat-ironstone-kitchenwares.jpg')} alt="Ironstone and antique kitchenware" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>Ironstone &amp; kitchenware</b></span>
          </a>
          <a class="collection-card collection-extra reveal" href="/the-collection/">
            <img src={imageUrl('103-cat-european-antiques.jpg')} alt="European farmhouse antiques" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>European antiques</b></span>
          </a>
          <a class="collection-card collection-extra reveal" href="/the-collection/">
            <img src={imageUrl('textiles.jpg')} alt="Vintage textiles and handmade pieces" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>Textiles &amp; handmade pieces</b></span>
          </a>
          <a class="collection-card collection-extra reveal" href="/the-collection/">
            <img src={imageUrl('122-garden-cart-flowers.jpg')} alt="Garden antiques and a cart filled with flowers" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>Garden antiques</b></span>
          </a>
          <a class="collection-card collection-extra reveal" href="/the-collection/">
            <img src={imageUrl('99-cat-seasonal-botanicals.jpg')} alt="Seasonal goods and gathered botanicals" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>Seasonal goods &amp; botanicals</b></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="interlude" aria-label="Roots and Relics philosophy">
        <img src={imageUrl('124-greenhouse-exterior.jpg')} alt="The Roots and Relics greenhouse in Southern Oregon" loading="lazy" data-parallax />
        <blockquote class="reveal">“A well-loved home<br />is never finished.”</blockquote>
      </section>

      <section class="visit section" id="visit">
        <div class="visit-top">
          <h2 class="reveal">Your next favorite<br />day starts <em>here.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="visit-card reveal">
          <div class="ticket-edge" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="visit-card-copy">
            <p class="kicker">ROOTS &amp; RELICS · SOUTHERN OREGON</p>
            <h3>Before you come</h3>
            <ul class="visit-notes">
              <li>Cash and Venmo are appreciated; credit cards are accepted.</li>
              <li>Many pieces are one of a kind and may not be available again.</li>
              <li>All sales are final, and there are no early sales.</li>
              <li>Children are welcome with supervision.</li>
              <li>Comfortable shoes are encouraged.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="visit-actions">
              <a class="solid-link" href="sms:5416788687">Text 541.678.8687 <span>↗</span></a>
              <a class="action-link action-link-dark" href="mailto:rootsandrelics.greenhouse@gmail.com">Send an email <span>↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="visit-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><span>SEE YOU IN</span><b>the<br />greenhouse</b><span>SOON · SOON</span></div>
          <div class="visit-card-image"><img src={imageUrl('116-sign-visit-notes.jpg')} alt="A chalkboard with notes for visiting Roots and Relics" loading="lazy" /></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
